---
/**
 * The Zerado nav lockup. One variant, never re-set in type, never glowed.
 * Non-interactive per design/blueprint.md §6.3 (components: Logotype,
 * interactive: false) — it is not a link; the nav's own links carry focus.
 * Ref: design/blueprint.md §7.8. viewBox is 0 0 364 64.
 */
---

<span class="z-logotype">
  <img src="/logo.svg" alt="Zerado" width="364" height="64" />
</span>

<style>
  .z-logotype {
    display: inline-flex;
    inline-size: 120px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .z-logotype img {
    inline-size: 100%;
    block-size: auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .z-logotype {
      inline-size: 140px;
    }
  }
</style>
